{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-hostile-species","chapterId":"handbook-monster-4012030","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-hostile-species-handbook-monster-4012030-handbook-monster-4012030-0","text":"由「纷争」雕琢的泰坦眷属，流淌着尼卡多利的金血。信仰如飞箭矢志不移，为泰坦造主的悬锋与凶矛寻取猎物，猎杀荒原中的奇兽与战场上的敌兵，射程之内无活物得以幸免。","speaker":""}]}
